# CODEOWNERS for c3x-pricing-api
#
# Every PR needs review from the maintainers group. GitHub will auto-request
# these reviewers on any changed path. Narrow rules can be added below the
# catch-all; most-specific wins.

*                       @c3xdev/maintainers

# Security-sensitive paths require a security reviewer in addition to a
# maintainer. The security group should be a subset of / orthogonal to
# maintainers.
/internal/server/       @c3xdev/maintainers @c3xdev/security
/internal/db/           @c3xdev/maintainers @c3xdev/security
/internal/config/       @c3xdev/maintainers @c3xdev/security
/.github/               @c3xdev/maintainers @c3xdev/security
/deploy/                @c3xdev/maintainers @c3xdev/security
/migrations*            @c3xdev/maintainers @c3xdev/security
